# Test-only mod for W2-P4 (rewrite/prompts/w2p4_client_combat_intents.md, C18, C23a, C23b2,
# C23b3).
# Data only. Each entry is the smallest change that makes one client combat path
# reachable with stock xcom1 data:
#   1. STR_RIFLE gains sprayWaypoints: 2 - the OXCE spray autoshot
#      (Ctrl+Shift+click on the AUTO aim, BattlescapeGame::primaryAction), which no
#      stock item enables. With battleConfirmFireMode off, the second waypoint click
#      fires; the 3 auto shots are spread over the two waypoints (C18).
#   2. STR_GRENADE gains unprimeActionName: ActionMenuState adds the UNPRIME row
#      only when that name is set and the unprime cost is > 0 (costUnprime defaults
#      to 25 %); stock grenades set no name, so they have no UNPRIME row (C23a).
#   3. STR_MEDI_KIT_ONE_CLICK: the stock medi-kit's data plus medikitType: 1 (heal),
#      so ActionMenuState heals at once instead of opening MedikitState (C23b2).
#      recover: false keeps it out of NEW BATTLE's generated base/craft stores
#      (NewBattleState adds only recoverable items), so starting loadouts, item ids
#      and the map are unchanged; tests hand it out with battle_give.
#   4. STR_MEDI_KIT_ONE_CHARGE (amendment C3-Q13, C23b3): the stock medi-kit's
#      data with ONE heal charge (painKiller 0, stimulant 0) and isConsumable:
#      true, no medikitType - the full MedikitState screen. After its one heal
#      every charge is 0, so vanilla's TileEngine::medikitRemoveIfEmpty removes
#      it. recover: false, as in 3, so NEW BATTLE's loadouts stay unchanged.
items:
  - type: STR_RIFLE
    sprayWaypoints: 2
  - type: STR_GRENADE
    unprimeActionName: STR_UNPRIME_GRENADE
  - type: STR_MEDI_KIT_ONE_CLICK
    size: 0.1
    weight: 5
    bigSprite: 24
    floorSprite: 24
    battleType: 6
    invWidth: 1
    invHeight: 2
    painKiller: 10
    heal: 10
    stimulant: 10
    woundRecovery: 1
    healthRecovery: 3
    stunRecovery: 4
    energyRecovery: 10
    tuUse: 10
    flatRate: true
    medikitType: 1
    recover: false
  - type: STR_MEDI_KIT_ONE_CHARGE
    size: 0.1
    weight: 5
    bigSprite: 24
    floorSprite: 24
    battleType: 6
    invWidth: 1
    invHeight: 2
    painKiller: 0
    heal: 1
    stimulant: 0
    woundRecovery: 1
    healthRecovery: 3
    stunRecovery: 4
    energyRecovery: 10
    tuUse: 10
    flatRate: true
    isConsumable: true
    recover: false
extraStrings:
  - type: en-US
    strings:
      STR_UNPRIME_GRENADE: "Unprime Grenade"
      STR_MEDI_KIT_ONE_CLICK: "One-click Medi-kit"
      STR_MEDI_KIT_ONE_CHARGE: "One-charge Medi-kit"
